  "description": "The Exorcism Agency is a state-run secret organization whose mission is to protect humans from demonic possession. Taehee Yoon, an exorcist from the Execution Department, is looking for a \"genius\" who can see and hear ghosts to be his new subordinate. While operating undercover at a high school he meets a mysterious boy...*\n\n\"By the way, how old are you, buddy?\"*\n\n(Source: Manta)",
